---
const showVideo = false; // Set to true later for A/B test
---

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-10 mb-12 px-6 fade-in">
  <div
    class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-md p-8 space-y-6"
  >
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center">
      Welcome to the USRad Network
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 text-center">
      A personal note from our founder before you begin
    </p>

    {
      showVideo ? (
        <div class="aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOUR_VIDEO_ID"
            title="Welcome to USRad"
            frameborder="0"
            allowfullscreen
            class="w-full h-full"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      ) : (
        <div class="text-base text-gray-800 leading-relaxed space-y-5 text-left">
          <p>
            <strong>Dear Imaging Center Leader,</strong>
          </p>

          <p>
            Welcome — and thank you for your interest in joining the USRad
            Network.
          </p>

          <p>
            You’ve taken the first step toward something powerful: filling
            unused scan slots, growing your patient volume, and gaining a
            competitive edge in a market that’s rapidly shifting toward
            affordability and access.
          </p>

          <p>
            At USRad, we believe that exceptional imaging care shouldn't be
            reserved for those with perfect insurance. That’s why we built a
            national platform that connects high-quality imaging centers like
            yours with self-pay patients who are actively looking for
            affordable, trusted options.
          </p>

          <p>
            We maintain one of the most comprehensive databases of over 30,000
            accredited imaging facilities in the U.S. — and we use it to help
            match your center with the right patients at the right time. That
            data advantage is part of what makes USRad uniquely effective at
            filling scan slots and driving volume.
          </p>

          <p>
            The journey ahead is simple — just a few short steps — and our
            system saves your progress automatically so you can start and stop
            at your convenience.
          </p>

          <p>Let’s grow together.</p>

          <p class="pt-4">
            <strong>
              Warm regards,
              <br />
              Michael Cabrera
              <br />
              Founder, USRad
              <br />
              Former CEO, AnciCare PPO
            </strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      )
    }
  </div>

  <style>
    .fade-in {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
      animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  </style>
</section>
